    "GAP-registry-live-map: Python __all__ exports REGISTRY as a live dict alias "
    "of the in-process table. Rust exposes ALL and lookup via get_recipe and "
    "list_recipes instead of handing out the map.",
    "GAP-registry-non-string-name: Python Recipe.__post_init__ raises ValueError "
    "when name is not a str. Rust Recipe::try_new takes &str and documents "
    "NON_STRING_NAME_UNREPRESENTABLE — parity not required on that branch.",
